 "note_en": "Adjective + 多了 means \"much more...\" when comparing with before: 感觉理智多了 \"I felt much more sensible.\" English puts \"much more\" before the adjective, but Chinese adds 多了 after it, and no 比 is needed when the comparison (with past years) is clear from context.",
